       </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18099173\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a5ef/d8c5/682011_normal.png?m=1779439985\" alt=\"evan1\" data-uid=\"682011\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/evan1\">evan1</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 10:35:00 +08:00\">19h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>新会话也不行吗。那先别用这个号了，过一个月再看看。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18099284\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6538/8113/268783_normal.png?m=1511232154\" alt=\"AiBoy\" data-uid=\"268783\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/AiBoy\">AiBoy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 10:48:01 +08:00\">19h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>确实不稳定，现在还会吃对话，转了半天，吃掉当前对话，无语了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18099391\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/55ba8fb4d6e79fbe22cdafd14f90416f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"xH1015\" data-uid=\"541508\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xH1015\">xH1015</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 11:02:02 +08:00\">19h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我也是，但是我发现用指纹浏览器就正常</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18099531\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/344ad10990c419876f6c7150030e0422?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Echo28\" data-uid=\"577331\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Echo28\">Echo28</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 11:23:53 +08:00\">18h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>macOS 客户端可以选 Astra 模型，智力正常，网页端好像只能选 Lastest ，勉强能用。要么就用 work 模式，选对应的模型，就是会消耗额度</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18099811\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/24b0eb05c14a2b7357663392fedea457?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"hdczsf\" data-uid=\"44858\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hdczsf\">hdczsf</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 12:10:38 +08:00\">18h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我是菲区 plus,原来用机场 ip,画个鹈鹕秒出,轮子飞上天,完全不可用.<br>后来买了个马来的 vps 做落地鸡,再画只有两脚悬空蹬空气,其他都正常了.昨天测了一下指纹,说是 gpt5.5,行吧,5.5 就 5.5,对我的需求也足够用了,别给降到 4o 就行.</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18099895\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b9afa09d1247549c2044a4ca18278cfa?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"qrobot\" data-uid=\"548928\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/qrobot\">qrobot</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 12:45:40 +08:00\">17h 34m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>gpt pro 会员，选择 Astra 模型， 网页聊天一直思考，我巴不得换个快点的模型出答案</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18100387\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e21b/feea/133262_normal.png?m=1760937293\" alt=\"lpe234\" data-uid=\"133262\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lpe234\">lpe234</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 14:38:04 +08:00\">15h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我还以为 Sol High 进化了，我也是，网页传图或者发文字，立马就回复...都不带停顿的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18100823\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6879/5a6d/456967_normal.png?m=1788615788\" alt=\"ixixi\" data-uid=\"456967\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ixixi\">ixixi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 15:53:04 +08:00\">14h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我也是一样的，鹈鹕测试 轮子满天飞。  过了两天自动好了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"uni · 20h 22m ago · 2013 views 一直开高推理，之前都是有几十秒到几分钟的思考之后才出的，从昨天开始就是直接出回答了，质量下降非常明显，codex 可以正常使用。我也是一直正常用，没有做过任何违规的事情（比如用来代替 codex 等），号也是我自己的号，最多就是代理的节点可能会变了 怎么办，求助 Supplement 1 · 15h 2m ago 更新：开无痕窗口登录同一个号就能用了，原窗口还是不行 降智 质量 解决10 replies • 2026-09-18 15:53:04 +08:00 1 liuxu 19h 47m ago 换 claude code 2 evan1 19h 44m ago 新会话也不行吗。那先别用这个号了，过一个月再看看。 3 AiBoy 19h 31m ago 确实不稳定，现在还会吃对话，转了半天，吃掉当前对话，无语了。